+# G2 stage polish3: the visual critic's third pass, worked most visible first
+
+Stage agent polish3, branch `g2/polish3` (cut from `g2/trunk` f677707, polish2 integrated), 2026-11-13. Scope: the
+nine ranked issues of the visual critic's iteration 3 on the benchmark scenes A–E, as many as could be done well, then
+the canonical capture set again and before/after sheets per issue. MonoGame 3D only, presentation only (DR42: nothing
+here reads back into the simulation; the battle trace of scenes C and D is read-only, and the tests that read it hash it
+before and after). All numbers below were measured in this container on **llvmpipe (Mesa software GL on 4 logical
+CPUs, 15 GB RAM, shared with a simulation lane that ran builds and mutants at the same time): llvmpipe, not Victus
+evidence**. No hardware GPU ran this code. The Director's quality references were used as references only; nothing
+player-facing names another game (D-069). These are prototype frames, not production art.
+
+@@VERDICT@@
